uous research and practice, we can unlock new formula of milk tea, meet customers' picky tastes, and make every cup of milk tea a unique work of art. There are lots of different ingredients to choose from to make your milk tea, fruit tea or coffee. And you will see your beautiful milk tea with your own eyes! Finally, you also need to play a fun R&amp;D game to tap into the full potential of your milk tea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/66ecc167e36ff6c3666c255130d23853.poster.avif?t=1756735666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/66ecc167e36ff6c3666c255130d23853.webm?t=1756735666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/66ecc167e36ff6c3666c255130d23853.mp4?t=1756735666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personally design and decorate your milk tea shop, from choosing the store layout to selecting the decorations, every step requires your unique vision and creativity. Let the store not only become a place for customers to taste delicious milk tea, but also become a warm space for them to relax and communicate.</p>","developers":["\u661f\u4e5d\u732b\u6e38\u620f-StarNineCat Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/3e89841b47c670bcc893eaebe56aa1079f3c3df0/header.jpg?t=1756735666","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<s